                <pb facs="0154" n="70" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg70"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that he held a conference on August 3 with the Prince on the
                    subject of Mr. Hay’s telegram of July 26. The Prince promises to reply very
                    soon.)</p>
            </div>
